From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: karthickk <karthickk@ami.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix DOTAuthState meson.build missing install directives

Add install, install_dir, and build_by_default to the DOTAuthState
generated_sources custom_target so that server.hpp and other headers
are installed to the sysroot during do_install.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Rebased onto main after patch 0013; overlapping existing definitions are
retained and missing generators are registered in the current Meson tree.

---
diff --git a/gen/com/nvidia/Software/DOTAuthState/meson.build b/gen/com/nvidia/Software/DOTAuthState/meson.build
--- a/gen/com/nvidia/Software/DOTAuthState/meson.build
+++ b/gen/com/nvidia/Software/DOTAuthState/meson.build
@@ -27,5 +27,14 @@
         meson.current_source_dir() / '../../../../../yaml',
         'com/nvidia/Software/DOTAuthState',
     ],
+    install: should_generate_cpp,
+    install_dir: [
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+        false,
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+    ],
+    build_by_default: should_generate_cpp,
 )
 

-- 
